          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw iyo ntumwa iragenda; ishitse, idondera Dawidi ivyo Yowabu yamutumye vyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iramubarira, it’ Abantu baho bāradutwariranije, badushikana no mu gahinga, ariko turaruha tubīgiza inyuma kurinda tubashikanye kw irembo ryabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ abanyamiheto bari bahagaze ku ruzitiro baturasa, twebge abantu bawe; hapfa bamwe bo mu bantu bawe, mwami, kandi hapfuye na wa muntu wawe w’Umuheti, Uriya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.2.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 2:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.46.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 46:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Dawidi yishura iyo ntumwa, at’ Uz’ ubarire Yowabu, ut’ Ivyo ntibikubabaze, uti Kukw inkota mu kwica ipfa uwo ihubiyeko; uti None rero shimika, uvyure akanyarigabo mu kurwanya ico gisagara, ukineshe. Ukw abe ari k’umurindisha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
